# Files excluded from every Vercel deploy in this repo.
#
# IMPORTANT: this file lives at the repository root and Vercel applies it to ALL projects
# built from this repo, whichever Root Directory they use. Never list lmslocal-web/ or
# lmslocal-admin/ here - excluding an app directory deletes it before the build and the
# deploy fails with the Root Directory pointing at nothing.
#
# Each project's Root Directory setting already limits what gets built, so listing the
# other app here buys nothing. Only genuinely non-deployable directories belong below.
lmslocal-flutter/
lmslocal-server/
docs/
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
server-check.txt
